(text "Pads on the bottom, for pogo pins, 2.54 mm.\nVCC in the middle, ground at both ends:\nput on backwards, only SDA and SCL swap.\n5 DETECT is tied to GND here: the console's\nGP7 pull-up reads low once the key is on.\nTwo 3 mm magnets in the board pull it down\nonto the pins and line it up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5407b031-15ec-4db2-81aa-10e7009ddf5c"))
